/* Cleanup applied during migration:
   - Dropped 15 dead class selectors never referenced in JSX.
   - Dropped all [data-theme=light] rules (app toggles theme via
     body.light-theme-active, never via a data-theme attribute).
   - Replaced off-palette cyan (#67e8f9 / #38bdf8) hover/focus values
     with monochrome tokens (--color-interactive-soft, --color-focus,
     --color-border-subtle) per brand.md "no cyan" directive.
   - Fixed pre-existing broken refs: --light-border → --color-border-medium,
     --light-text-strong → --color-text-primary (both were undefined in theme.css).
   - Dropped one bogus bare-h3 grid rule (minification artifact; the real rule
     for .tax-workbench-scenario-row already exists in styles.css).
   - Tokenized stray slate borders/text ported from theme.css (var(--color-text-secondary), #5f7d8b,
     #334155) to --color-border-subtle / --analytics-line / --color-text-secondary. */

